OL,3,GNEWSABid to transform area into UK's
OL,4,Afilm capital
OL,5,
OL,6,FBosses of the West of England hope to
OL,7,Ftransform the region into the film
OL,8,Findustry capital of the UK amid a #4.5m
OL,9,Ffunding boost.
OL,11,FThe region, which includes Bristol and
OL,12,FBath, is already the country's
OL,13,Fthird-largest screen hub, with huge
OL,14,Fseries including Rivals, The Outlaws,
OL,15,FThe Other Bennet Sister and Young
OL,16,FSherlock already being filmed in the
OL,17,Farea.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
