OL,3,GNEWSABid to transform area into UK's
OL,4,Afilm capital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new grant scheme, Greenlight West,
OL,7,Fnow aims to attract large productions
OL,8,Fby helping to cover associated costs,
OL,9,Fgiving the West an edge over other
OL,10,Flocations.
OL,12,FHelen Godwin, mayor of the West of
OL,13,FEngland, said: "With this new
OL,14,Fincentive, we're sending a clear
OL,15,Fmessage to the sector. We want you to
OL,16,Fmake more magic here."
